calculated from in situ observations reached a new high of 1942 ± 2 ppb in 2024, an increase of 8 ppb with respect to the previous year (Figure 6a). This increase is lower than both the increase of 11 ppb from 2022 to 2023 and the average annual increase of 10.6 ppb over the past
